# Everything Max creates at runtime lives in data/ and is personal. Max recreates the folder on start.
#   memory:   about_me.md, claude_chats.md, max_memory.json, history.json, claude_topics_cache.json
#   secrets:  config.json (AI API keys)
#   private:  location.json, server.log, browser-profile/ (cookies, mic permission)
#   build:    MaxNative.dll (compiled from server/MaxNative.cs on first start)
data/

# Memory files, in case they ever appear outside data/
**/about_me.md
**/claude_chats.md
**/max_memory.json
**/history.json
**/claude_topics_cache.json
**/memory/

# Keys, passwords, tokens
.env
.env.*
**/config.json
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*secret*
*token*

# Misc
*.log
*.bak
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
